  "description": "The imager is set to operate at a frame rate of\u202f10.0\u202ffps with the full sensor window retained (clipping left\u202f0, top\u202f0, right\u202f175 and bottom\u202f131). Motion\u2011artifact reduction is disabled, while spatial and temporal filtering are both enabled at level\u202f1. Both distance and amplitude images are filtered, using a symmetry threshold of\u202f0.5 and a minimum amplitude of\u202f45. The two\u2011frequency line\u2011distance limit is\u202f85\u202fpercent, and the three\u2011frequency limits are set to\u202f75\u202fpercent for the 2\u2011F line and\u202f78\u202fpercent for the 3\u2011F line. Amplitude correction and rectification for both distance and amplitude images are active, and continuous auto\u2011exposure is turned off.\n\nAuto\u2011exposure parameters are configured for a target amplitude of\u202f2000, with a long\u2011short exposure factor ranging from\u202f2\u202fto\u202f40. The short\u2011exposure hard constraint is\u202f80\u202fpercent and the long\u2011exposure hard constraint is\u202f90\u202fpercent. The reference mode is type\u202f1, using a rectangular ROI defined as\u202f{\"ROIs\":[{\"id\":0,\"group\":0,\"type\":\"Rect\",\"width\":130,\"height\":100,\"angle\":0,\"center_x\":88,\"center_y\":66}]} and a reference point at\u202fX\u202f=\u202f88,\u202fY\u202f=\u202f66. The exposure time list offered by the device is\u202f\"100,200,400\".\n\nThe configuration type is reported as\u202f\"O3D3xx\", the private profile is\u202f\"under5m_low\", and the optional 100\u202fkHz output is disabled. All settings reflect the current operational profile for this imager."
